## Verifier 四维评分

```mermaid
graph LR
    subgraph 四个维度
        R["result\n任务结果是否达到目标\n权重 × 0.5"]
        P["process\n执行过程是否合理\n权重 × 0.2"]
        Q["quality\n输出质量\n权重 × 0.3"]
        C["compliance\n合规检查\n一票否决"]
    end

    R & P & Q --> COMP["composite\n= result×0.5 + process×0.2 + quality×0.3"]
    C -->|"passed=false"| VETO(["ComplianceVeto\n立即终止整个任务"])
    COMP --> JUDGE{"overallPassed?"}
    JUDGE -->|"composite >= threshold\n& compliance passed"| OK(["✅ 通过"])
    JUDGE -->|"失败"| RETRY["触发 Replan / 回滚"]
```

